#### 2_06 msg - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_cutscene01"
	val[]: "For the final scenario of this chapter, we'll drive on the test track with a complex configuration."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_cutscene02"
	val[]: "The first obstacle is a slalom through some barriers. Drive through it and remember to use your mirrors."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_cutscene04"
	val[]: "Next is a hairpin turn. Keep your turn wide and it shouldn't pose you any problems."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_cutscene05"
	val[]: "There is a 90 degree left turn here. Remember to drive in deep so that the rear of the truck clears the inside barriers."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_cutscene06"
	val[]: "The ramp obstacle can be a bit tricky. Line yourself up as best as you can before you drive onto it and use your front and side mirrors to help orient yourself."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_cutscene08"
	val[]: "The next section must be done in reverse. Approach the barriers ahead with that in mind."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_cutscene09"
	val[]: "მიჰყევით გზის მონიშვნებს თქვენ უკან და მარჯვნივ."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_cutscene10"
	val[]: "უკუსვლით იარეთ დაბრკოლებისკენ, შემდეგ შეჩერდით და წინსვლა განაგრძეთ მარცხნისკენ."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_cutscene11"
	val[]: "განაგრძეთ შუისკენ მომდევნო მონაკვეთამდე."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_cutscene13"
	val[]: "This passage through the cones is very narrow. Drive slowly and use your mirrors to orient yourself within the passage."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_cutscene15"
	val[]: "Remember to drive in deep on 90 degree turns."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_cutscene16"
	val[]: "You are entering a nice open section of road. You can pick up some speed, but keep in mind you'll need to slow down soon for the curve up ahead."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_cutscene18"
	val[]: "At the bottom of the hill there are some barriers across the road. Drive up to them, then reverse into the parking spot on the left."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_cutscene19"
	val[]: "უკუსვლით სადგომ ადგილას."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_cutscene20"
	val[]: "დააყენეთ სატვირთო, ჩააქრეთ ძრავა და დაიცავით დაგორებისგან."

#### 2_06 Driving Instructions



	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_forward"
	val[]: "In front of you is a slalom made of barriers.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Drive through the slalom.</font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_check1"
	val[]: "Keep towards the outside of the turn to ensure the rear of the tractor doesn't go over the kerb.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Make the turn. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_check2"
	val[]: "You are coming up to a 90 degree left turn. Remember to use all the space you have available.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Make the turn. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_check3"
	val[]: "Align yourself with the ramp. There isn't much room to make corrections once you are on it.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Drive over the ramp. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_check4"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Follow the course to the left. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_check5"
	val[]: "მომდევნო მონაკვეთი უნდა შესრულდეს უკუსვლით. შეჩერდით ზღუდესთან წინ, რომ შემდეგ უკუსვლით შეძლოთ მარჯვნივ გახვევა.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>შეჩერდით ზღუდესთან.</font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_reverse"
	val[]: "Reverse towards the area behind you and to the right. There are arrows on the road to help assist you.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Reverse towards the next section. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_check6"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Keep reversing towards the barriers behind you.</font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_check7"
	val[]: "Stop and change into a forward gear, then continue to the left. <br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Drive forwards. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_check8"
	val[]: "There is a break in the median to the left. Drive through it.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Continue onwards. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_check9"
	val[]: "In front of you is a narrow winding path through some cones. Drive carefully and use your mirrors if necessary.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Drive through the cones. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_check10"
	val[]: "Continue through the course.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Turn left. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_check11"
	val[]: "Remember to keep left before the turn to give yourself as much room as possible.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Make the turn. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_check12"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Continue driving. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_check13"
	val[]: "You can pick some speed up here, but there is a curve coming up ahead.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Continue along the course. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_check14"
	val[]: "The curve gets sharper as you make your way through it.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Adjust your speed accordingly and carry on.</font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_check15"
	val[]: "At the bottom of the hill you will see barriers blocking the road. <br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Stop near the barriers. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_check16"
	val[]: "Behind you and to the left, there is a parking spot.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Reverse into the parking spot. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_check17"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Stop in the marked spot. </font>"
#!{
	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_2_01_end@@"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_06_start"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_2_02_start@@"
