#### 2_09 msg - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_09_cutscene1"
	val[]: "გასწვრივ ჩაყენების უნარი გადამწყვეტი მნიშვნელობისაა და ყველა მძღოლმა უნდა იცოდეს.<br>მოემზადეთ დასაძრავად."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_09_cutscene2"
	val[]: "Drive towards the parking spot.<br>Pay attention to your surroundings."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_09_cutscene3"
	val[]: "Align yourself with the truck in front of your parking spot. Don't be too close to it, keep some distance from it so you have room to work."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_09_cutscene4"
	val[]: "Turn sharply towards the space and start reversing."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_09_cutscene5"
	val[]: "When looking out your driver's side mirror, aim for kerb just in front of the truck behind you."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_09_cutscene6"
	val[]: "Once your front bumper clears the truck ahead of you, you can begin steering the front end of the truck into the spot, aligning the truck with the parking spot."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_09_cutscene7"
	val[]: "გაასწორეთ საჭე და მიმართეთ შუისაკენ სადგომ ადგილას.<br>დააყენეთ სატვირთო და დაიცავით დაგორებისგან."

#### 2_09 Driving Instructions

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_09_start"
	val[]: "Ahead of you there are some parked trucks. There's one open space left for you to park in. <br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Prepare to set off. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_09_check1"
	val[]: "Remember to be aware of your surroundings. Make good use of your mirrors throughout this manoeuvre. <br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Drive forwards. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_09_stopmid"
	val[]: "<color value=@@clr_white@@>Drive past the parking spot and into the marked area. From there you can begin your reversing manoeuvre.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Stop in the marked spot. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_09_checkmirror"
	val[]: "Check your surroundings for obstacles and to make sure you are clear to reverse.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Look through the passenger's side mirror. </font>"


	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_09_backward"
	val[]: "Turn your wheels and reverse into the parking spot.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Start reversing. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_09_stop"
	val[]: "Start straightening the truck out when appropriate. Don't drive over the kerb!<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Align the truck with the spot. </font>"
#!{
	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_09_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_2_01_end@@"

#!}
#@}

