	val[]: "უკუსვლა მისაბმელით"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book1_3_05_desc"
	val[]: "In this scenario, you'll try your hand at reversing with a trailer for the first time. It is a fairly simple manoeuvre, but you'll still need to steer correctly to put the trailer into the correct position."

